Parser-only adapter provenance

lib/engine-adapter.js adapts the local anydoc/PDF orchestration from
@jiaoqsh/dsh-document 0.1.3 (author: jiaoqsh, license: MIT).
The original standalone lib/pdf-worker.js is used unmodified from its verified
package closure. The plugin entrypoint is not imported into standalone Node.
The native subprocess owns cancellation and resource/output bounds.
